 r←Test_AskDate_003(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForDate" module and select a date
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If 0 ⍝TODO⍝  See bug <01137>
     myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
     myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
     parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForDate
     parms.addToCaption←'Date needed'
     parms.date←2015 5 30

     n←myGuiParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateDateRequest''
     ∆Process n.∆Form
⍝ ⎕NQ n.DateTime'DateTimeChange' 42519 0 0 0
     1 ⎕NQ n.DateTime'DateTimeChange' 42500 0 0 0
     ∆Process n.∆Form
     ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
     ∆Process n.∆Form

     →GoToTidyUp 2015 5 30≢n.∆result
     r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
     :Trap 0 ⋄ n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap

 :EndIf
